@host = http://localhost:5191

### A book
GET {{host}}/api/books/2

### Not found: GetBookError's BookNotFound, its id in details
### 404 library_1001, details { bookId: 99 }
GET {{host}}/api/books/99

### Not signed in: 401, the same error body
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Solaris", "author": "Stanisław Lem" }

### Invalid: the ambient ValidationFailed, documented by ProducesErrors(400)
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: alice
X-Role: member

{ "title": "", "author": " " }

### Created: 201, Location /api/books/{id}
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: alice
X-Role: member

{ "title": "Solaris", "author": "Stanisław Lem" }

### Conflict: AddBookError's BookExists, with the id of the book already there
### 409 library_1002, details { bookId: 1 }
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: alice
X-Role: member

{ "title": "dune", "author": "frank herbert" }

### On loan: DeleteBookError's BookOnLoan, with who has it
### 409 library_1003, details { borrowers: ["alice", "bob"] }
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/1
X-User: alice
X-Role: member

### Deleted: 200, no body
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/2
X-User: alice
X-Role: member

### The OpenAPI document: 404 and 409 from the error sets, 400/401/403 from this package
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
